# tests/ is NOT ignored, deliberately.
#
# It was, at first, and that was a mistake: it meant the content gate that keeps
# personal detail out of this repo was itself never committed here, and commit
# messages cited check counts for files the repo did not contain. Tests describe
# code, not a person, and tests/check_no_personal.mjs proves that on every run.

